<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">记下</view>
  <view class="page-sub">把聊天摘录、照片收进「我们的点滴」。读不到微信正在聊的内容。</view>

  <view class="hero card">
    <view class="hero-kicker">聊天摘录</view>
    <view class="hero-title">从聊天文件导入一段对话</view>
    <view class="hero-desc">请先在电脑版微信导出聊天，或把要留下的那段复制成文件后再选择。不会自动读取正在聊的记录。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="importFromApp">选择 App 导出文件</view>
    <view wx:if="{{importHint}}" class="hint" bindtap="goMemories">{{importHint}}，去回忆集看看</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero card secondary">
    <view class="hero-kicker">补充配图</view>
    <view class="hero-title">照片最多 {{maxCount}} 张</view>
    <view class="hero-desc">记下这一次一起拍的照片。默认压预览图，不必导入整机相册。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="choosePhotos">从相册精选</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{lastCount}}" class="result">
    <view class="result-head">
      <view class="result-title">刚刚导入 {{lastCount}} 张</view>
      <view class="result-link" bindtap="continueImport">继续精选</view>
    </view>
    <photo-grid photos="{{lastPhotos}}" />
    <view class="actions">
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="goTag">去打标签</view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goMemory">做成回忆集</view>
    </view>
    <view class="link" bindtap="goLibrary">先去照片库看看</view>
  </view>
</view>
